30,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found out that renting a whole building makes the bill even for everyone! That sounds much fairer, doesn't it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I see. All-in rates can be unfair to light eaters, but a single bill for a house is very clear.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I've learned that shared houses can feel crowded, but total independence can make us drift apart. We need a balance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The island trip takes two full days just for travel. The spa town is only ninety minutes by train.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The inn has a strict schedule and shared rooms... but the island houses only have one bathroom and the water might be cold.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, two days of travel is a long time! But a big house sounds so fun!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, a single bathroom for five people sounds like a recipe for chaos and hidden costs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If we want to actually spend time together without feeling trapped, maybe the spa town is a good middle ground?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Toshio,,I strongly prefer the train. Spending a third of our trip just waiting for ferries is inefficient.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't like the idea of everyone in one room on futons. A city room has a door.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Sakura,,But the city is so separate! I want us to be together!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,A city break seems expensive and fragmented. The costs would be all over the place.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, would the spa town be okay if we have the public baths to spread out in?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The city is the most efficient for movement, but the spa town is a reasonable compromise on travel time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I guess... as long as I don't have to share a single bathroom with everyone all week.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Let's pick something where we don't fight over the bill!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"The island is cheapest per night, but the logistics and facilities seem poor.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Midori,,I think the spa town offers the best balance of togetherness and personal space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I'm voting for the spa town. It's the most time-efficient and organized.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I think the city is safest for my sleep, but the spa town is better than the island.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
