55,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I still like the island house for the even bill, but the cold water sounds yucky! I'll go for the spa town!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The spa town's all-in rate is a bit risky for the budget, but it's the most predictable total cost. I vote C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Midori,,"To ensure we stay connected but have room to breathe, I vote for the Hot Spring Town.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I vote C. The travel time is minimal and the structure is clear.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the futons, but the city feels too lonely. I'll vote C too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, everyone likes the spa town!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,It seems to be the only option that satisfies everyone's basic requirements.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we found a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
